WEBVTT

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.030
Shuza...

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:27.000
<b>The Nadir of Anguish</b>

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:40.600
We've had word that you've re-established
the Black King Suppression Army.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.510
We received a request for reinforcements.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:48.250
However, we will not fight alongside 
the Suppression Army.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.070
You will not win with your methods.

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.480
We will defeat the Black King.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.230
What gives you the right to talk like that?

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.390
Who do you think you are?

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:03.240
Restrain yourself.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:09.040
This man is Shuza, First Lord of the Nine
Territories of Fire in the land of ogres.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.490
I am Second Lord, Yoshitsugu.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.550
I like your spirit, brat.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:14.770
I'm not a brat!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.010
I'm Aram!

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:20.010
I'm tired of your nonsense, idiot!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:22.970
Don't just stand there! Say something, Yuri!

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.440
Hand over the Chain Chronicle.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.900
I'd never give it to the likes of you!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.890
Move.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.190
Shuza.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.940
Now's not the time for in-fighting.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.260
You haven't changed, boy.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.770
Did I not warn you?

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.860
Mercy will only hold you back during war.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.040
That is why you lost to the Black King.

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:03.470
Use any means necessary when 
fighting the Black King.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.320
Be prepared to use your comrades
as shields if necessary.

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.850
Mercy will only hold you back.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.690
This is how I fight.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:18.830
Yuri!

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.260
Sheathe your sword!

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.400
We would prefer to avoid
any unnecessary bloodshed.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.540
Now, then.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.280
The Chronicle's power only manifests
for those it has chosen.

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.930
Then I'll just make it choose me.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.480
Do you think you can do that?

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:37.550
That's why I'm standing here now.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.070
Stop!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:57.540
Try as we might to quell the riots, 
the people are still restless.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.420
If crossing swords with the 
Black Army is a form of battle,

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:04.940
then so is fighting your own anxieties.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.950
I fight daily against my own anxieties.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:15.520
My duties as one of the Seventeen 
Clerics of the Great Shrine...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.960
As a decision-maker, with the 
world on the verge of collapse,

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:25.680
I must choose who to entrust with
leading the world into the future.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:31.410
As a cleric—no, as a human being—

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.390
I have been troubled by 
the duty with which I am faced.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:40.210
But it is no longer the time for that.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:44.010
What I must do has already been decided.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.160
You're right, Lilith.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.990
What we must both do

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.860
has already been decided.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:54.990
I must let the people 
know what I am thinking.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:06:01.760
I don't know if it'll alleviate their fears, 
but I must convey my thoughts.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.640
Please gather the people.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:15.840
Until now, Louise, Einslotte, and I have 
shared the duties of the Holy Queen.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.750
You helped me when I lacked experience,

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.090
but I've been using that as
an excuse to shirk my responsibilities.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.230
Juliana...

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:30.000
Seeing the nation in its current state, 
I finally understand what I must do.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.510
To quell the people's fears,

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:42.370
a ruler must first show them how to
move forward and how to live their lives.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:47.130
I will carry out my duty as 
the successor to the throne.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.180
Juliana...

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.480
I admire your determination.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.610
Her Majesty Juliana will 
be succeeding the throne.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.650
We will thus be holding 
a coronation ceremony.

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.280
Aram! Take care of Phoena!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.090
All right.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.630
I'd expect nothing less from
 the Second Lord of the Nine Territories.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.720
Bring it!

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.020
Shuza.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:44.390
Can we not fight alongside 
one another again?

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:45.400
Enough.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:51.110
I was given a choice between light and dark.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.400
If you choose to follow the path of light,

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.550
then I shall follow the path of darkness.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.530
I will take everything.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.480
The Nine Territories.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:05.870
Yggdra.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:07.880
And the power of the blackness.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:12.880
I will claim this power as my own, 
and become the true Black King!

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:22.900
Yuri!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.180
Yuri!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.210
Begone, weaklings!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.150
Captain!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.320
A chain attack, quick!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.960
Seize...

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:57.220
Captain!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.470
Yuri!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.470
He broke their chain!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.400
You're pretty sure of yourself, brat.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.630
Aram!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.500
Now, hand it over.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.700
No.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.460
Stop!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.930
Shuza!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.900
Who the hell are you?

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.460
Its name is Olzada.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.840
An ancient golem said to bring calamity.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.180
Isn't it cute?

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:34.690
It's time for you to come home.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.410
A demon.

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:38.410
Oh?

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:41.360
It seems you're not unlike us.

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:43.600
Want to come along, too?

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.950
Don't make me laugh, scum.

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:47.330
Oh?

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.730
Then I hate to say it, 
but you'll have to die.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.920
Protect the lord!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.420
How ugly.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.180
I have no use for the weak.

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.140
Beautiful.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.560
I'll cut you down!

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:13.560
Let's burn them all down!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.020
You pests.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:27.490
Come, let us go join the King.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:33.170
Your fate was sealed the moment you 
appeared in front of the Black King.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.890
That's nonsense.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:38.390
You're already stained black.

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:43.010
Now, let's go.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:47.340
Why do you hesitate?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.530
Look.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:54.770
You failed to protect your friends.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:55.860
No!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.150
And you let the Chain Chronicle be stolen.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.650
Yet again.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.280
W-Well...

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.410
It's the truth.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.790
Dammit...

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.260
Aram...

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.100
Phoena.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.700
The Chain Chronicle...

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.460
I'll get it back.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.100
Yuri, no!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.470
You can't go!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.520
I'll stop him!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.020
You shall not interfere.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.210
You already understand, don't you?

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.720
You're weak.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.080
I, I...

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.520
Now, accept it.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:47.360
I... I...

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.810
Now...

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.380
I almost had you.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:05.050
I vowed to defeat the Black King this time.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.510
I will not waver!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:12.170
I will prevail, with my friends!

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.020
Your friends?

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:23.100
Why do you think your friend, 
Burckhardt, became a demon?

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.030
Aram!

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.830
Take a look at your friends.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.790
I won't hand Yuri over!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.860
It's his fate.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:41.340
I don't care!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.600
Everyone has their rightful place.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:46.970
I was rejected by the person
I gave my all to.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:53.300
That's when I understood 
the mistake I'd made.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:55.300
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.870
You're a wreck.

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.310
So are they, see?

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:12.490
Oh, no.

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.750
Yoshitsugu, why?

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.430
You could have stopped Shuza.

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:25.230
Me? Stop him?

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.360
I have my honor as an ogre.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:32.630
I bet what little life I have left on Shuza.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.270
Just as you bet yours on Yuri.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:40.770
I will fight for the one I placed my trust in.

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.480
Same goes for me.

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:55.930
The poor things.

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:59.790
They're going to die, all because 
they decided to believe in you.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.670
It's all your fault.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:05.700
It's my...

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:09.130
That's right. You can't protect anyone.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.680
I... I...

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:17.480
Yuri!

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.690
Don't go!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:25.430
You knew you weren't a hero.

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:30.870
You knew you didn't have the 
ability to protect your friends.

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:34.070
But you couldn't admit that to yourself.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.410
No, the people around you wouldn't let you.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.570
That's not true!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:41.710
There isn't a single ray 
of hope in this world.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.290
It will all soon be engulfed in black.

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:49.950
But when that happens, you will be set free.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:54.180
What is the point in suffering or
making your friends suffer any longer?

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.390
I...

00:15:56.390 --> 00:16:02.310
The peace you seek is, in fact, 
in the world of darkness.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:09.230
Do your friends—your people—the kindness 
of ending things with your own hands.

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:15.450
That is the only path left to you.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:19.220
Kindness? Ending... things?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.620
Yuri!

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:26.830
Come with me.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.580
To the world where you belong.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:35.450
You can't protect anyone any longer.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.750
Follow your heart.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:42.740
I... I...

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.430
Yuri!

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.270
I won't let the blackness defeat me!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.250
Is that your answer?

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.880
Kain... Why...

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.440
Captain...

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:26.940
You severed that fleeting bond
with your own hands.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.320
Kain!

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:35.710
Are you all right, Captain?

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:36.780
I...

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.810
As long as you're okay,
that's all that matters.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:42.210
The Black King Suppression Army needs you.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:44.800
Kain.

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.100
Kain!

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.130
Captain!

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.020
What?

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.860
We'll gather troops from
every corner of the land

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:15.020
and form a Black King Suppression <i>Army</i>.

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:17.900
Our leader has high hopes for you.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:22.250
Follow the path you believe to be true.

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:25.530
Hope?

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:28.000
How does that help?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.120
The people begged you to save the world.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:37.910
The world tasked you with saving it 
because you are a hero.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.160
I've been waiting for you.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:59.030
This continent of Yggdra is faced 
with an unprecedented trial.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:05.640
And this nation, too, has been engulfed 
in darkness with no end in sight.

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:10.500
But that doesn't mean all hope is lost.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.190
Today, I have made the decision to—

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:14.580
Who do you think you are?

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:15.330
It's your fault.

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:17.240
It's your fault we lost the war!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.210
Yeah!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:26.410
When my father was killed by the Black Army,

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:32.110
my heart fell into the depths of despair.
I lost the light.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:40.160
Obsessed, I threw myself into a fruitless 
battle to avenge my father.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:45.270
I involved friends who were dear to me, 
causing them to suffer.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:51.790
That's when a certain warrior stopped me.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:53.890
He scolded me with sincerity.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:56.830
He was concerned for me, and he confronted me.

00:19:56.830 --> 00:20:01.050
Thanks to him, I was able to stop myself.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:13.200
Alas, when I returned,

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:17.940
I found my people devoid of light,
as I was before.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:23.990
I know from experience that only ruin awaits
if we continue down this path.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:28.120
That's why I must be strong.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:32.000
You are like family to me, after all.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:38.250
I have made the decision to take the throne.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:43.600
To bring the light of hope
back to our hearts.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:50.190
We must now become one and fight together.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:21:01.190
This ancient Holy Kingdom has avoided 
many a tragedy with our strong bonds.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:06.060
With such bonds, there is nothing 
against which we cannot prevail.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:12.010
We will never be defeated by the darkness.

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:18.850
For the noble Holy Kingdom 
and for its proud people,

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.720
let the light of hope shine bright!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:37.620
In the name of the Seventeen Clerics,

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.970
Juliana, I hereby crown thee
Queen of the Holy Kingdom.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>Torn Apart</b>

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:48.820
Fate is set in motion.
